{"id":"ddf55dc38efa1e78","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-quasi-isomorphism.md","title":"Quasi-Isomorphism","display":"df-quasi-isomorphism — Quasi-Isomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quasi-isomorphism","aliases":["58-df-quasi-isomorphism","Quasi-Isomorphism"],"display":"df-quasi-isomorphism — Quasi-Isomorphism","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quasi-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quasi-isomorphism</span><span>Quasi-Isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quasi-isomorphism — Quasi-Isomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"434d3c43afd7cf17\" href=\"?note=434d3c43afd7cf17\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md\">../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,C,D,d_C,d_D\\in V\">\\(f,C,D,d_C,d_D\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"434d3c43afd7cf17\" href=\"?note=434d3c43afd7cf17\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md\">../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (本文件定义)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The upstream predicate includes both the chain-map condition and bijectivity of every induced map on homology.</li>\n<li>Derived category: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D(C) = K(C)/\\sim_{\\text{qiso}}\">\\(D(C) = K(C)/\\sim_{\\text{qiso}}\\)</span>; formalizes &quot;equal up to homotopy+quasi-iso&quot;</li>\n<li>Resolutions: injective/projective resolutions give quasi-isomorphisms; compute derived functors</li>\n<li>TSDC: triangulated structure; distinguished triangles from null-homotopic maps</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Weibel, An Introduction to Homological Algebra</li>\n<li>Kashiwara and Schapira, Categories and Sheaves</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"434d3c43afd7cf17","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md","status":"resolved","id":"434d3c43afd7cf17","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch14/58-df-isomorphism-inhomology.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,C,D,d_C,d_D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}quasi\\text{-}isomorphism} \\vdash \\mathrm{QuasiIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{HomologyIso}_S(f,C,D,d_C,d_D)","display":true},{"tex":"D(C) = K(C)/\\sim_{\\text{qiso}}","display":false}],"bytes":1223,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1025","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-quasi-isomorphism.md|58-df-quasi-isomorphism]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["434d3c43afd7cf17"]}